<title>USA: U.S. DAP and ammonia prices slightly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP and ammonia prices slightly higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were slightly higher on Friday with strong demand from India and China, brokers said. Also, supply interruptions were reported as a major producer took downtime for repairs, one broker said.</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   179-180			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     184-187			up 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   228-230			up 3</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
